  "description": "DEPRECATED: old HTML to PDF handler package. Use Rmp.DocProc.HtmlToPdf instead. It supports the same legacy .NET Framework 4.6.2+ versions, so migrating does not require a runtime upgrade. Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
  "id": "Rmp.DocProc.Handlers.HtmlToPdf",
